      "writtenOn": "2024-07-04T07:06:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you elaborate why ISE is preferred over IAE? I saw `#unregisterStateCallback` and `ConnectivityManager#unregisterNetworkCallback` throw IAE in this case.\n\nIf we\u0027re going to use ISE, shall we also change let `#registerConfigurationCalblack` throw ISE when it\u0027s already registered?",
