      "writtenOn": "2024-07-29T06:48:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason ISE is more correct is that the callback per se is not invalid. The callback is valid - it just hasn\u0027t been registered yet.\n\nThat said: per discussion on GVC, the other register/unregister functions already call IAE not ISE, so being consistent with those is better.",
